  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Thanks Phil.  I've confirmed that your suggested fix gets past the problem reported.  (both wildcards and args with spaces)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "However, it always passes a fixed # of args to the program.  So if I run fedora-find.sh with too few args, the 7th one looks like \"\" (empty string) to the java program.  Ideally, it's simply not provided to the program, since it wasn't provided by the user running the script.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I lifted the following technique from the ant shell script, which seems to fit the bill:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "exec_args=",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "for arg in \"$@\" ; do",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "exec_args=\"$exec_args \\\"$arg\\\"\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "done",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "exec_cmd=\"exec $JAVA_HOME/bin/java ... $exec_args\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "eval $exec_cmd",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
